note bay 1 review of 36edfca2: renames on a packet with trailing bytes traps 3 before any kernel call,
note even though its first name is absolute (ngrun would otherwise refuse it as outside scratch, 119).
fn main to int
a = new uchar 11 0
put a 0 2
put a 2 2
put a 4 47
put a 5 120
put a 6 1
put a 8 98
put a 9 122
put a 10 122
k = renames a 0 11 0
ret int and k 255
end
